<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>AFTI - Training &amp; Certification Programs</title>
</head>
<body style="background-color: #0f172a; color: #ffffff; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0;">

  <!-- Universal Navigation Bar -->
  <nav style="background: #144d29; padding: 1rem 2rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 1000;">
    <div style="font-weight: 900; font-size: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: -0.5px; color: #ffffff;">AFTI Portal</div>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <a href="index.html" style="color: #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95rem;">Home</a>
      <a href="programs.html" style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; border-bottom: 2px solid #27ae60; padding-bottom: 2px; font-size: 0.95rem;">Training &amp; Certification</a>
      <a href="partners.html" style="color: #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95rem;">For Farmers</a>
      <a href="shared-harvest.html" style="color: #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95rem;">Shared Harvest</a>
      <a href="incubator.html" style="color: #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95rem;">Incubator</a>
      <a href="newsletter.html" style="color: #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95rem;">Newsletter</a>
      <a href="gallery.html" style="color: #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95rem;">Gallery</a>
      <a href="how-to-help.html" style="color: #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95rem;">How to Help</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 2rem;">
    
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <div style="background: #1e293b; padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <span style="background: rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.15); color: #27ae60; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Vocational Mastery</span>
      <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 900; color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0; letter-spacing: -0.5px;">Training, Cohorts &amp; Preparatory Waitlist</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1; margin: 0;">
        AFTI combines rigorous hands-on field production with structured leadership tracks. To ensure early success stories, we screen for dedicated core cohorts while maintaining an engaged preparatory waitlist to scale seamlessly for regional harvest surges and grower needs in Linn County.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Pipeline Pillars Grid -->
    <div style="display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      
      <!-- Active Cohort -->
      <div style="background: #1e293b; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
        <h2 style="color: #27ae60; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.3rem;">🎯 Active Cohort: Finding the Core Diamonds in the Rough</h2>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
          Our initial active groups are vetted for grit, reliability, and resilience. Candidates undergo practical screening—including on-site task trials and reliability checks—to prepare them to become future industry trainers, micro-farmer success stories, and reliable farm leads.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Preparatory Waitlist -->
      <div style="background: #1e293b; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
        <h2 style="color: #27ae60; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.3rem;">⏳ Preparatory Waitlist &amp; Foundation Track</h2>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
          Waitlist participants stay actively engaged through introductory modules, community workdays, and baseline safety workshops. This track builds readiness points, allowing us to rapidly activate surge labor when peak harvest periods demand extra hands.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Grower-Driven Alignment -->
      <div style="background: #1e293b; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
        <h2 style="color: #27ae60; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.3rem;">🤝 Grower-Driven Skill Customization</h2>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
          Willamette Valley partner growers specify their exact operational requirements—from irrigation management to specialty harvesting. Our curriculum dynamically tailors training to match these requests, bridging talent directly to employment.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Application / Waitlist Sign-up Form -->
    <div style="background: #1e293b; padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Program Application &amp; Waitlist Registration</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: #cbd5e1; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        Apply for our active training track or secure your spot on our preparatory waitlist to qualify for upcoming placement slots.
      </p>

      <form action="#" method="POST" style="display: grid; gap: 1.25rem;">
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem;">
          <div>
            <label style="display: block; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: #cbd5e1; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Full Name *</label>
            <input type="text" name="name" required placeholder="e.g., Alex Smith" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.875rem; background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 8px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1rem;">
          </div>
          <div>
            <label style="display: block; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: #cbd5e1; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Phone Number *</label>
            <input type="tel" name="phone" required placeholder="(541) 555-0144" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.875rem; background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 8px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1rem;">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label style="display: block; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: #cbd5e1; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Email Address *</label>
          <input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="alex@example.com" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.875rem; background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 8px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1rem;">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label style="display: block; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: #cbd5e1; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Desired Track / Status</label>
          <select name="track_selection" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.875rem; background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 8px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1rem;">
            <option value="active">Active Cohort Application</option>
            <option value="waitlist">Preparatory Waitlist &amp; Community Track</option>
            <option value="micro-farmer">Micro-Farmer Independent Track</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label style="display: block; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: #cbd5e1; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Experience &amp; Background Notes</label>
          <textarea name="background_notes" rows="4" placeholder="Share any relevant trade experience, farming interest, or goals..." style="width: 100%; padding: 0.875rem; background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 8px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1rem; font-family: inherit; resize: vertical;"></textarea>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" style="background: #27ae60; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; padding: 1rem 2rem; border: none; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s; margin-top: 0.5rem;">Submit Registration</button>
      </form>
    </div>

  </main>
</body>
</html>
